_1440.png", "id": "1412451040495807", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618288_1412451043829140_3172190558726510506_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=umzZMHP6eOcQ7kNvwE8HLE8&_nc_oc=AdpVZg3pL2rppY3HiTYtJRCFRnHWLlkHsZ-p79TCC36ywPLOMdo05IbMUEmVgVVfuPA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQkDJubyXqAygH4iVs-94r5cY2t-sqDfDaiqEGXnLbagg&oe=6AFB2A91"}, "display_name": "Skybound Legacy", "keywords": ["Rollercoaster", "ImmersiveVRride", "Virtualrollercoaster", "ThemeparkVR", "FantasycoasterVR"], "long_description": "Welcome to Skybound Legacy! Prepare for a high-speed, heart-pounding rollercoaster experience through a meticulously crafted, classic old village.\n\nStrap in for a visually stunning journey that whips past quaint half-timbered houses, over cobblestone bridges, and through the vibrant town square. The village is teeming with life: friendly birds flutter past your head, and curious animals watch you zip by.\n\nThis isn't just about speed; it's about pure, engaging visual charm. Every twist, turn, and drop is synchronized to reveal breathtaking scenes of the peaceful countryside. Skybound Legacy: Village Run offers a fluid, captivating ride that is both intensely thrilling and wonderfully immersive, making it the perfect blend of speed and enchantment.", "short_description": "Experience a thrilling VR rollercoaster through a magical kingdom."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xrexarplay-cloud.github.io/SkyboundLegacy-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "exarplay", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://exarplay.in/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_